\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Where the gain lives: AUPRC of the three-checkpoint ensembles by how many entities the passage names. Biodiversity: distinct taxa that TaxoNERD \citep  {leguillarme2022taxonerd} finds in the passage; an argument ``is not a taxon'' when TaxoNERD does not recognise it there. BioRED: gold-annotated concepts in the sentence; it has no relation term, hence no triple-conditioned model. The grey bar is the gain from asking about the pair. Exact values and per-block results: Appendices~\ref  {app:where} and~\ref  {app:biored}.\relax }}{6}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:where}{{3}{6}{Where the gain lives: AUPRC of the three-checkpoint ensembles by how many entities the passage names. Biodiversity: distinct taxa that TaxoNERD \citep {leguillarme2022taxonerd} finds in the passage; an argument ``is not a taxon'' when TaxoNERD does not recognise it there. BioRED: gold-annotated concepts in the sentence; it has no relation term, hence no triple-conditioned model. The grey bar is the gain from asking about the pair. Exact values and per-block results: Appendices~\ref {app:where} and~\ref {app:biored}.\relax }{figure.caption.12}{}}
